[Word Retention and Geometric Reaccess, Theorems 3.2 and 4.2](RECURSIVE_RELATIONAL_OBSERVATION_WORD_RETENTION_AND_GEOMETRIC_REACCESS.md#4-固定编码器的准确调用与加权价格)
